        'honestly when a particular shade of color will need extra upkeep, and always running a small patch '
        'test before trying anything new on sensitive skin or scalp. Many of their conversations begin with '
        'something very simple, like booking the next available slot or deciding between a walk-in visit and a '
        'proper appointment, and then wander naturally into bigger decisions, like whether to go for a bold new '
        'color before a big event, whether gel polish or regular polish will last longer through a busy week, '
        'or whether a deep tissue massage might finally ease the tight knot sitting stubbornly in one shoulder. '
